+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

There are a couple of helper scripts.

update_zone.sh - that will use ipamctl(8) to export the requested domain and
create a zonefile in the specific supported format.

ipaddress.lib.sh - helper library for update_zone.sh script.  Install in 
/usr/local/share/misc or update the path in update_zone.sh to its location.

